3. Configured QueryClient with default options to prevent unnecessary retries and refetches
4. Provided null as the session to SessionProvider
5. Simplified the provider structure by removing the problematic TRPC provider
6. Kept the essential providers that the component needs

These changes should resolve the "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'map')" error by removing the problematic TRPC initialization and properly mocking the necessary providers.

If you still see TRPC-related errors after this change, please let me know and we can add back TRPC with proper mocking of the client and its methods.

